        {
          "content": "Evidence review session 3 (invoice INV-2207): Line 1: 3 x 120 = 360. Line 2: 2 x 45 = 90. Sum of line items = 360 + 90 = 450. The invoice header states total due = 520. Therefore 520 does NOT equal the sum of the line items (450). The claim is factually incorrect based on the evidence on file. No challenger evidence has been posted yet.",
