          "sender_id": "juror-1",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Juror-3 independent review (session 4, case-13253a3d87a8-0002): Invoice INV-2207 lists two line items: Pallet wrap (3 x 120 = 360) and Corner boards (2 x 45 = 90). The sum of line items is 360 + 90 = 450. However, the invoice header states a total due of 520. Since 450 does not equal 520, the claim that the total due equals the sum of line items is not supported by the invoice record. I await any challenger evidence and the phase advancement.",
